WEBVTT

STYLE
::cue(c.color9CD5FF) { color: #9CD5FF; }

1
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:07.000 line:5% align:center
<b><c.color9CD5FF>One Pace Addon</c></b>

2
00:01:30.030 --> 00:01:35.950
<b>Banquet Hall


Third Floor


Inside

the Castle</b>

3
00:01:30.700 --> 00:01:32.290
[BLACK MARIA]
I really should
get to those samurai

4
00:01:32.290 --> 00:01:35.540
before someone else
steals all the glory.

5
00:01:36.330 --> 00:01:37.920
It's time to get serious.

6
00:01:37.920 --> 00:01:41.260
A little hands-on time
and he'll melt in an instant.

7
00:01:41.260 --> 00:01:42.960
[chuckles]

8
00:01:42.960 --> 00:01:45.090
[BLACK MARIA]
Ready to broadcast his message

9
00:01:45.090 --> 00:01:47.470
all over the island,
Caiman Lady?

10
00:01:47.470 --> 00:01:48.620
[CAIMAN LADY]
Yes, ma'am.

11
00:01:48.620 --> 00:01:49.990
All right, Black Leg.

12
00:01:49.990 --> 00:01:53.950
I'm very busy, so time
for you to call Nico Robin.

13
00:01:54.730 --> 00:01:55.980
Aw. You don't want
to keep my girls

14
00:01:56.350 --> 00:01:58.750
waiting all night,
do you? [chuckles]

15
00:01:58.060 --> 00:02:04.150
<b>The Honorable Hyogoro "the Flower"</b>

16
00:01:58.750 --> 00:02:01.380
We've set up a very
elaborate trap, you see.

17
00:02:01.380 --> 00:02:03.630
My webs,
"Hard Gum," I call them,

18
00:02:03.630 --> 00:02:06.430
are lining the
entrance in layers.

19
00:02:07.050 --> 00:02:08.550
They're lining the floor, too,

20
00:02:08.550 --> 00:02:11.770
so one step inside
and you're stuck.

21
00:02:11.770 --> 00:02:14.600
My subordinates are waiting
with tranquilizer guns

22
00:02:14.600 --> 00:02:17.350
to fire on my prey.

23
00:02:18.560 --> 00:02:20.940
[BLACK MARIA]
The rest is up to you.

24
00:02:26.110 --> 00:02:27.360
[Black Maria grunts]

25
00:02:27.360 --> 00:02:30.700
So, call Nico Robin
or I'll make you pay!

26
00:02:34.860 --> 00:02:38.780
Come on. I'm in a hurry here.

27
00:02:39.070 --> 00:02:41.990
I need to go finish off
those samurai!

28
00:02:43.950 --> 00:02:45.700
[SANJI]
Robin.

29
00:02:48.120 --> 00:02:50.670
What I want is to join you.

30
00:03:27.120 --> 00:03:28.250
No!

31
00:03:28.530 --> 00:03:34.820
[panting]

32
00:03:36.230 --> 00:03:38.380
[SANJI]
You want me to talk?

33
00:03:38.740 --> 00:03:42.060
All right then,
I've got a few words!

34
00:03:44.160 --> 00:03:47.450
He's going to say something
like "screw you," isn't he?

35
00:03:47.450 --> 00:03:47.690
Black Leg!

36
00:03:47.690 --> 00:03:48.660
Black Leg! Don't do it!

37
00:03:48.660 --> 00:03:50.230
Don't do it! She'll really
make you suffer!

38
00:03:50.230 --> 00:03:52.290
She'll really make you suffer!

39
00:03:52.290 --> 00:03:52.360
[SANJI]
Robin.

40
00:03:52.360 --> 00:03:55.110
[SANJI]
Robin. I'm sorry.

41
00:03:55.570 --> 00:03:57.760
It looks like this is it for me.

42
00:03:57.760 --> 00:03:58.380
I wish I could have seen
you smile one last time.

43
00:03:58.380 --> 00:04:01.470
I wish I could've seen
you smile one last time.

44
00:04:07.020 --> 00:04:08.640
Help me, Robin!

45
00:04:08.000 --> 00:04:08.330
Help me, Robin! Help me! Please!

46
00:04:08.640 --> 00:04:13.200
Help me! Please!

47
00:04:13.950 --> 00:04:15.280
[chuckles]

48
00:04:15.280 --> 00:04:17.120
[GIFTERS]
What?!

49
00:04:17.120 --> 00:04:21.450
He called her
for help after all?!

50
00:04:21.450 --> 00:04:23.330
[Black Maria chuckles]

51
00:04:24.000 --> 00:04:27.710
[SANJI]
I'm on the third floor!
In the Banquet Hall!

52
00:04:28.080 --> 00:04:31.510
I've been taken hostage!
I'm sorry!

53
00:04:31.510 --> 00:04:33.050
Sanji.

54
00:04:33.380 --> 00:04:36.640
[SANJI]
They said if you don't
come here soon, they'll kill me!

55
00:04:36.640 --> 00:04:38.850
My life is in your hands!

56
00:04:38.850 --> 00:04:41.310
Please come rescue me!

57
00:04:42.410 --> 00:04:44.560
Pathetic! Put the bastard
out of his misery!

58
00:04:44.560 --> 00:04:47.270
One of the Straw Hats
is in trouble! Oh no!

59
00:04:47.270 --> 00:04:48.610
A broadcast?

60
00:04:48.610 --> 00:04:51.190
They must want all of
Onigashima to hear it.

61
00:04:51.190 --> 00:04:55.780
[Who's-who's roars]

62
00:04:55.780 --> 00:04:59.160
Nico Robin is one of the most
important figures in the world.

63
00:04:59.160 --> 00:05:04.960
Of course. It figures that
they're after her knowledge.

64
00:05:04.960 --> 00:05:06.210
[FRANKY]
Sounds like they're trying to

65
00:05:06.210 --> 00:05:08.710
lead Robin into a trap.

66
00:05:09.380 --> 00:05:12.710
It's one thing for a man to cry,
but that's downright whiney.

67
00:05:12.710 --> 00:05:15.260
[laughs]

68
00:05:20.190 --> 00:05:22.850
[chuckles]
Those Straw Hats
are one of kind!

69
00:05:22.850 --> 00:05:25.640
I bet a woman got him
and he won't fight back.

70
00:05:25.640 --> 00:05:27.060
Go figure.

71
00:05:27.060 --> 00:05:30.650
Hey, Nami! Sanji's voice,
it's coming from that cat!

72
00:05:30.650 --> 00:05:31.940
[SANJI]
Be careful!

73
00:05:31.940 --> 00:05:34.030
I saw one earlier.

74
00:05:34.280 --> 00:05:35.990
They all have that
weird eye on their face.

75
00:05:35.990 --> 00:05:39.570
[SANJI]
I'm begging you! Robin!

76
00:05:39.570 --> 00:05:49.020
[panting]

77
00:05:47.430 --> 00:05:49.020
[chuckles]

78
00:05:49.020 --> 00:05:50.680
I can't believe it.

79
00:05:52.230 --> 00:05:54.230
- [Gifters gasp]
- [cracking]

80
00:05:54.230 --> 00:05:56.400
[SANJI]
All right, I called for Robin.

81
00:05:56.400 --> 00:05:59.190
Keep your word. Untie me.

82
00:05:56.440 --> 00:05:57.980
[chuckles]

83
00:05:59.270 --> 00:06:00.360
What the...?

84
00:06:03.320 --> 00:06:04.400
Someone's here!

85
00:06:04.400 --> 00:06:05.990
And it sounds like
we're under attack!

86
00:06:05.990 --> 00:06:08.080
Well! That was fast!

87
00:06:08.080 --> 00:06:10.910
You're so naive.
You think I'd let you go?

88
00:06:10.910 --> 00:06:12.290
[gasps]

89
00:06:12.290 --> 00:06:15.000
If I recall, you said
you loved me, right?

90
00:06:15.000 --> 00:06:17.920
That means this matter
isn't business anymore.

91
00:06:17.920 --> 00:06:19.830
It's personal.

92
00:06:19.830 --> 00:06:21.420
You can be my precious pet.

93
00:06:21.420 --> 00:06:23.790
You'll fit in with the rest
of them perfectly.

94
00:06:23.790 --> 00:06:28.000
[Samurai groan]

95
00:06:28.300 --> 00:06:30.170
[Black Maria chuckles]

96
00:06:30.170 --> 00:06:33.590
[BLACK MARIA]
I'll make your
body unable to live without me.

97
00:06:33.590 --> 00:06:37.560
[SAMURAI]
We love you and
you alone, Lady Black Maria.

98
00:06:36.130 --> 00:06:38.380
[Black Maria chuckles]

99
00:06:38.350 --> 00:06:38.430
[SANJI]
Impossible.

100
00:06:38.430 --> 00:06:39.640
[SANJI]
Impossible. 'Cause I
wanna love all the ladies!

101
00:06:39.640 --> 00:06:42.060
'Cause I wanna love
all the ladies!

102
00:06:42.060 --> 00:06:44.100
Being unfaithful already?

103
00:06:44.100 --> 00:06:44.480
Then you'll have to punished!

104
00:06:44.480 --> 00:06:45.980
Then you'll have to be punished!

105
00:06:45.980 --> 00:06:47.020
Hold on!

106
00:06:47.020 --> 00:06:49.520
I don't want to
hurt a lady's fist.

107
00:06:49.520 --> 00:06:52.650
I'll drop my Armament Haki!

108
00:06:52.990 --> 00:06:54.940
Mil Fleurs, go!

109
00:06:54.940 --> 00:06:55.690
go!

110
00:06:57.240 --> 00:06:59.030
Gigantesco Mano!

111
00:06:57.840 --> 00:06:58.840
[gasps]

112
00:06:58.840 --> 00:07:00.120
Mano!

113
00:07:00.120 --> 00:07:01.750
And Spank!

114
00:07:07.500 --> 00:07:08.960
[CAIMAN LADY]
My lady!

115
00:07:08.960 --> 00:07:10.000
[groans]

116
00:07:11.240 --> 00:07:12.610
[Black Maria gasps]

117
00:07:18.760 --> 00:07:21.260
How did you manage
to get in here?

118
00:07:24.010 --> 00:07:27.010
[ROBIN]
My flowers can bloom anywhere.

119
00:07:28.440 --> 00:07:30.810
You dare to slap my face?

120
00:07:31.150 --> 00:07:32.980
That wasn't much of a plan.

121
00:07:32.980 --> 00:07:34.730
You thought I'd walk
straight into your trap

122
00:07:34.730 --> 00:07:37.110
just because Sanji called me?

123
00:07:37.110 --> 00:07:39.990
I'm so glad you're here!

124
00:07:40.320 --> 00:07:42.490
[chuckles]

125
00:07:46.690 --> 00:07:50.390
I was part of an evil
organization for quite a while.

126
00:07:50.390 --> 00:07:54.400
So I can't help but show
my devilish side, sometimes.

127
00:07:54.400 --> 00:07:54.810
[chuckles]

128
00:07:54.810 --> 00:07:58.940
Especially if someone is foolish
enough to harm my friends.

129
00:08:00.360 --> 00:08:02.900
[gasps]

130
00:08:04.960 --> 00:08:06.550
I beg your pardon.

131
00:08:06.550 --> 00:08:09.420
Just passing through with the
cold gales of the underworld.

132
00:08:09.420 --> 00:08:10.880
[laughs]

133
00:08:10.880 --> 00:08:12.050
Brook!

134
00:08:12.050 --> 00:08:13.680
[gasps]

135
00:08:16.300 --> 00:08:19.680
Bad news! Our entire ambush unit
has been taken out!

136
00:08:19.680 --> 00:08:21.270
The traps were destroyed, too!

137
00:08:21.270 --> 00:08:23.440
He froze the threads
and shattered them!

138
00:08:23.440 --> 00:08:27.860
[laughs]
I'm a bit surprised
it turned out quite so well.

139
00:08:27.860 --> 00:08:30.440
The wicked winds of hell
know no bounds.

140
00:08:28.470 --> 00:08:29.510
[laughs]

141
00:08:30.470 --> 00:08:35.310
[BROOK]
Oh... You're scary!

142
00:08:38.160 --> 00:08:40.200
[GIFTERS]
Oh, you're one to talk!

143
00:08:40.830 --> 00:08:42.250
Thanks, Brook.

144
00:08:42.250 --> 00:08:44.250
I think you mighta
saved my life.

145
00:08:44.250 --> 00:08:46.460
Any time, and any place.

146
00:08:46.460 --> 00:08:47.710
Hate to say it.

147
00:08:47.710 --> 00:08:49.380
I'd be better off
helping Kin'emon

148
00:08:49.380 --> 00:08:52.050
and the others on the roof.

149
00:08:53.180 --> 00:08:54.300
[SANJI]
For some reason,

150
00:08:54.300 --> 00:08:56.600
I feel like I just
can't win this one.

151
00:08:56.600 --> 00:08:57.930
[BOTH]
– You're right about that.
– You're right about that.

152
00:08:57.930 --> 00:08:59.520
Come back, Black Leg!

153
00:08:59.520 --> 00:09:01.600
You were meant to be my pet!

154
00:09:01.600 --> 00:09:03.520
I won't let you go!

155
00:09:03.770 --> 00:09:04.810
Any last words?

156
00:09:04.810 --> 00:09:05.900
[gasps]

157
00:09:10.280 --> 00:09:12.030
Or is that it?

158
00:09:17.530 --> 00:09:21.410
Ugh. Why are you protecting
that idiot when he sold you out?

159
00:09:21.410 --> 00:09:23.620
You really think he's
worth your life?

160
00:09:23.620 --> 00:09:26.290
How sad. You don't have friends.

161
00:09:26.290 --> 00:09:29.090
If you did, you would
surely understand.

162
00:09:32.420 --> 00:09:35.550
It's a fine thing,
trusting someone.

163
00:09:35.800 --> 00:09:36.930
[gasps]

164
00:09:36.930 --> 00:09:38.140
[ROBIN]
Sanji!

165
00:09:40.390 --> 00:09:41.890
Thanks for counting on me.

166
00:09:41.890 --> 00:09:44.980
I mean it. That made me happy.

167
00:09:47.190 --> 00:09:49.050
[BROOK]
Oh, wait! Watch the ice...

168
00:09:49.050 --> 00:09:51.010
Yeah.

169
00:09:51.590 --> 00:09:54.680
Huh? [gasps]

170
00:09:54.680 --> 00:09:56.740
[Both gasp]

171
00:09:56.740 --> 00:09:58.450
Good luck, you two!

172
00:09:58.450 --> 00:10:02.370
<b>Forbidden Storeroom

Inside the Dome</b>

173
00:10:05.430 --> 00:10:07.850
[SHINOBU]
Mice don't normally do that.

174
00:10:08.180 --> 00:10:09.900
It's from Father's
surveillance team.

175
00:10:09.900 --> 00:10:11.150
They're known as "The Marys."

176
00:10:11.150 --> 00:10:11.230
Cyborg?

177
00:10:11.230 --> 00:10:13.900
It's a cyborg. Thus the smoke.

178
00:10:13.900 --> 00:10:15.660
They're modified animals.

179
00:10:15.660 --> 00:10:17.870
They've been fitted with
mechanical body parts.

180
00:10:17.870 --> 00:10:19.410
How strange!

181
00:10:19.910 --> 00:10:21.580
These creatures
wander around the island

182
00:10:21.580 --> 00:10:23.290
without a particular objective,

183
00:10:23.290 --> 00:10:25.290
but they can share
what they see,

184
00:10:25.290 --> 00:10:26.920
and the human Marys take note.

185
00:10:26.920 --> 00:10:28.030
[Momonosuke, Shinobu gasp]

186
00:10:28.030 --> 00:10:29.530
But where else could we go?

187
00:10:29.530 --> 00:10:31.530
- [footsteps]
- [gasps]

188
00:10:35.700 --> 00:10:37.960
[BEAST PIRATE A]
Sure this is where they're at?

189
00:10:37.960 --> 00:10:39.620
Hard to say,
since no one's been to

190
00:10:39.620 --> 00:10:41.420
this cursed place in ages.

191
00:10:41.420 --> 00:10:43.540
[BEAST PIRATE C]
Doesn't look
like anyone's opened the door,

192
00:10:43.540 --> 00:10:44.920
or broken in even.

193
00:10:44.920 --> 00:10:47.260
[BEAST PIRATE D]
Hey, we got
nothing else to go on.

194
00:10:47.260 --> 00:10:49.090
Let's bust in there
and find out.

195
00:10:49.090 --> 00:10:52.350
Kill the kid and Young Master
Yamato can be the next Shogun!

196
00:10:52.350 --> 00:10:54.310
It sounds like they
sent a whole team.

197
00:10:54.310 --> 00:10:57.230
And if we stay here long,
they're only going to send more.

198
00:10:57.230 --> 00:10:58.560
Let's run, Yamato!

199
00:10:58.560 --> 00:11:00.100
Can you help us find
a path that will

200
00:11:00.100 --> 00:11:04.070
keep Lord Momonosuke
out of their sights?

201
00:11:04.570 --> 00:11:07.240
We know you're in there!
Come on out!

202
00:11:07.240 --> 00:11:09.900
[BEAST PIRATE B]
Don't make us
break the door down!

203
00:11:09.900 --> 00:11:11.950
[BEAST PIRATES]
One, two!

204
00:11:13.660 --> 00:11:14.780
[Momonosuke gasps]

205
00:11:14.780 --> 00:11:16.160
We have to move, now!

206
00:11:16.160 --> 00:11:17.410
I'm sorry, Momonosuke!

207
00:11:18.500 --> 00:11:20.330
I need you to hide
in my clothes!

208
00:11:20.330 --> 00:11:22.750
Huh? What?!

209
00:11:24.250 --> 00:11:26.960
[Beast Pirates yell]

210
00:11:31.680 --> 00:11:34.800
[Beast Pirates groan]

211
00:11:34.800 --> 00:11:36.260
Time to go, Shinobu!

212
00:11:36.260 --> 00:11:39.180
I thought the idea was
to stay hidden from the enemy!

213
00:11:39.180 --> 00:11:41.020
[Beast Pirates groan]

214
00:11:41.020 --> 00:11:42.440
Not to worry!

215
00:11:42.440 --> 00:11:44.440
We'll keep Momonosuke hidden
till we knock them out!

216
00:11:44.440 --> 00:11:46.150
[Beast Pirates yell]

217
00:11:45.110 --> 00:11:48.610
[Killer groans]

218
00:11:46.190 --> 00:11:47.150
[yells]

219
00:11:47.150 --> 00:11:48.610
[Beast Pirates groan]

220
00:11:48.610 --> 00:11:50.740
That is not what I meant at all!

221
00:11:55.390 --> 00:11:57.560
Uhh, no need to worry,
Master Jack,

222
00:11:57.560 --> 00:12:00.060
we're blocking
this passage for you!

223
00:12:00.400 --> 00:12:01.770
You really should get some rest.

224
00:12:01.770 --> 00:12:05.480
[JACK]
Shut up! Outta my way!

225
00:12:07.320 --> 00:12:11.200
Are the Akazaya samurai still
in the Treasure Repository?

226
00:12:11.200 --> 00:12:17.700
[panting]

227
00:12:18.000 --> 00:12:19.960
[BAO HUANG]
They sure are!

228
00:12:20.540 --> 00:12:23.500
Black Maria! Where are you?

229
00:12:23.500 --> 00:12:26.000
[BLACK MARIA]
I'm still in the Banquet Hall.

230
00:12:27.170 --> 00:12:29.010
[JACK]
All right. Stay there and I'll

231
00:12:29.010 --> 00:12:31.680
finish off the samurai myself!

232
00:12:31.680 --> 00:12:33.340
[Beast Pirates scream]

233
00:12:33.340 --> 00:12:34.540
[BEAST PIRATES]
Die!

234
00:12:36.000 --> 00:12:38.720
[Jack panting]
Even if they're badly injured,

235
00:12:38.720 --> 00:12:40.100
they're strong.

236
00:12:40.100 --> 00:12:43.350
Too strong to fall to
one of the Tobi Roppo.

237
00:12:44.480 --> 00:12:47.570
This is my battle, understand?

238
00:12:47.570 --> 00:12:49.230
[BLACK MARIA]
Really underestimating me,

239
00:12:49.230 --> 00:12:51.030
aren't you, Jack?

240
00:12:56.700 --> 00:13:01.160
[BLACK MARIA]
But that's fine.
It works out this time.

241
00:13:03.180 --> 00:13:06.640
Sweet Entanglement

242
00:13:04.960 --> 00:13:08.340
[cackles]

243
00:13:08.340 --> 00:13:11.550
[BLACK MARIA]
The prey here
is far more interesting.

244
00:13:15.010 --> 00:13:17.600
What is that thing? A weapon?

245
00:13:20.770 --> 00:13:23.940
[BLACK MARIA]
It won't be
long now, Nico Robin.

246
00:13:23.940 --> 00:13:26.560
Soon, you'll belong to Kaido.

247
00:13:27.610 --> 00:13:30.150
I'll make sure of that.

248
00:13:30.740 --> 00:13:35.490
Not likely.
You'd have to kill me first.

249
00:13:35.490 --> 00:13:37.490
[BROOK]
She's so cool!

250
00:13:49.890 --> 00:13:52.730
<b>Onigashima

Entrance</b>

251
00:13:51.410 --> 00:13:53.750
Candy Maiden!

252
00:14:01.730 --> 00:14:06.430
A splendid effort,
warriors of the full moon.

253
00:14:06.850 --> 00:14:08.970
Candy Armor!

254
00:14:13.500 --> 00:14:15.760
A pity your power
is lickity-limited

255
00:14:15.760 --> 00:14:17.960
by the whims of the weather!

256
00:14:19.110 --> 00:14:21.610
[Perospero gasps]
It's melting!

257
00:14:29.040 --> 00:14:33.880
[PEDRO]
Listen! You-gara
must keep moving forward!

258
00:14:34.380 --> 00:14:34.630
I won't stop till
I avenge Pedro!

259
00:14:34.630 --> 00:14:35.920
I can't die.

260
00:14:41.970 --> 00:14:43.970
What are you avenging, girl?

261
00:14:43.970 --> 00:14:47.390
This is war! Pedro was
prepared to die!

262
00:14:48.270 --> 00:14:51.730
Why did you come to Big Mom's
territory in the first place?

263
00:14:51.730 --> 00:14:55.070
'Cause it sure as hell
wasn't for a lickity-picnic!

264
00:14:55.730 --> 00:14:58.490
If you wanna live that bad,
you should stay home!

265
00:14:58.490 --> 00:15:01.280
Go frolicking in
the damned forest!

266
00:15:01.280 --> 00:15:03.120
[Carrot groans]

267
00:15:04.120 --> 00:15:05.540
[Perospero chuckles]

268
00:15:07.330 --> 00:15:10.960
Your days of playing
pirate are over, bunny.

269
00:15:13.580 --> 00:15:15.000
All right.

270
00:15:15.000 --> 00:15:16.960
I'm not fond of
this lickity-alliance

271
00:15:16.960 --> 00:15:19.510
with the Beast Pirates,
but oh well!

272
00:15:18.710 --> 00:15:20.880
[Beast Pirates groan]

273
00:15:19.550 --> 00:15:22.890
If that's what Mama decided,
I have no choice.

274
00:15:22.890 --> 00:15:25.350
Besides, it's a good
chance to teach those

275
00:15:25.350 --> 00:15:28.930
Worst Generation punks
a lickity-lesson!

276
00:15:28.930 --> 00:15:34.860
[cackles]

277
00:15:32.890 --> 00:15:35.520
[Big Mom cackles]

278
00:15:35.520 --> 00:15:37.690
[BAO HUANG]
And they're running!

279
00:15:37.690 --> 00:15:40.770
The enemy leader Momonosuke
is getting away!

280
00:15:40.770 --> 00:15:46.240
If nobody stops him,
there's gonna be trouble!

281
00:15:46.820 --> 00:15:50.120
[Beast Pirate G chuckles]

282
00:15:54.910 --> 00:15:56.870
[Beast Pirate J groans]

283
00:15:56.870 --> 00:16:00.040
[BAO HUANG]
They must be
hiding Momonosuke somehow!

284
00:16:00.040 --> 00:16:02.590
I haven't been able
to spot him yet,

285
00:16:02.590 --> 00:16:03.980
but Momonosuke is there

286
00:16:03.980 --> 00:16:04.380
He's with Young Master
Yamato and the kunoichi!

287
00:16:04.380 --> 00:16:07.090
with Young Master Yamato
and the kunoichi.

288
00:16:07.090 --> 00:16:09.180
I know it!

289
00:16:13.950 --> 00:16:16.910
<b>Momonosuke

General of Wano's Samurai</b>

290
00:16:19.640 --> 00:16:21.060
[MOMONOSUKE]
It's cramped and difficult

291
00:16:21.060 --> 00:16:23.730
to breathe in here,
but never mind that!

292
00:16:23.730 --> 00:16:26.530
For some reason,
even though my life is danger,

293
00:16:26.530 --> 00:16:28.610
I feel like I'm in heaven!

294
00:16:29.610 --> 00:16:34.200
[Beast Pirates yell]

295
00:16:36.200 --> 00:16:38.210
Quick, Shinobu, this way!

296
00:16:38.660 --> 00:16:40.750
Curses! They keep coming!

297
00:16:40.750 --> 00:16:44.700
[Beast Pirates groan]

298
00:16:44.700 --> 00:16:46.500
Can you take us
somewhere else, please?

299
00:16:46.500 --> 00:16:47.960
We need to get out of sight!

300
00:16:47.960 --> 00:16:49.380
It's under control!

301
00:16:49.380 --> 00:16:52.000
They can't see us once
they're unconscious, you know!

302
00:16:52.000 --> 00:16:53.600
If we could find
a place to hide,

303
00:16:53.600 --> 00:16:56.420
then they would never
see us in the first place!

304
00:17:00.600 --> 00:17:04.560
[panting]

305
00:17:02.580 --> 00:17:06.960
<b>Third Floor

Inside the Castle</b>

306
00:17:13.280 --> 00:17:15.030
Another broadcast, huh?

307
00:17:15.030 --> 00:17:17.660
Now they're going after
Momo and Shinobu.

308
00:17:18.410 --> 00:17:22.290
But who is "Yamato"?
Well, whatever.

309
00:17:22.290 --> 00:17:25.340
Hey! Where is the
Forbidden Storehouse?

310
00:17:25.340 --> 00:17:27.550
I'll never tell you!

311
00:17:28.090 --> 00:17:29.590
Yeah?

312
00:17:29.590 --> 00:17:32.800
[Beast Pirate I groans]
Uh, the front of the Skull Dome.

313
00:17:32.800 --> 00:17:36.260
It's right near
the front entrance.

314
00:17:36.930 --> 00:17:40.520
Kin'emon's group should be
at the back of the castle tower.

315
00:17:38.120 --> 00:17:43.460
<b>Dome Entrance</b>
<b>Back of the Castle Tower</b>

316
00:17:40.520 --> 00:17:43.560
What a pain.
That's the opposite way.

317
00:17:44.810 --> 00:17:47.940
Kin'emon and the others are
injured from fighting Kaido.

318
00:17:48.230 --> 00:17:51.740
Momo and Shinobu are
being chased by Gifters.

319
00:17:51.740 --> 00:17:53.990
I don't know who needs me more!

320
00:17:54.740 --> 00:17:57.530
How do I decide?

321
00:18:01.450 --> 00:18:03.370
[SANJI]
No time to think about it!

322
00:18:03.370 --> 00:18:04.750
Let's see.

323
00:18:04.750 --> 00:18:07.960
Whoever needs me the most
has got to be this way!

324
00:18:13.360 --> 00:18:18.580
[Kojuro panting]

325
00:18:17.160 --> 00:18:20.540
[panting]

326
00:18:20.540 --> 00:18:21.830
I can't.

327
00:18:28.160 --> 00:18:32.300
[Kojuro panting]
This blue flame
draws out my strength,

328
00:18:32.300 --> 00:18:34.180
but it's all spent.

329
00:18:36.600 --> 00:18:38.350
[KOJURO]
There's nothing left.

330
00:18:42.150 --> 00:18:43.270
Keep fighting!

331
00:18:43.270 --> 00:18:45.320
Dig deeper than
you ever have before!

332
00:18:45.320 --> 00:18:48.360
If you don't, the next time
you turn into an Ice Oni,

333
00:18:48.360 --> 00:18:50.700
you'll run wild till you die!

334
00:18:52.860 --> 00:18:55.910
[HYOGORO]
This is no time
to despair, young man.

335
00:18:55.910 --> 00:18:58.540
Stand up and show some courage.

336
00:18:58.960 --> 00:19:02.370
Mister Raccoon is enduring
the same pain as you,

337
00:19:02.370 --> 00:19:04.920
but he's still working
on those antidotes.

338
00:19:04.920 --> 00:19:07.250
We can't give up before he does.

339
00:19:08.300 --> 00:19:11.800
[KOJURO]
Boss? What happened to you?

340
00:19:15.300 --> 00:19:19.350
I've still got some fight left,
even if I'm old!

341
00:19:21.810 --> 00:19:24.310
A true samurai
fights to the end!

342
00:19:24.310 --> 00:19:27.730
Stand back.
I'll show you how it's done!

343
00:19:31.610 --> 00:19:32.610
Help, Apoo!

344
00:19:32.610 --> 00:19:34.780
Please, we can't win
without you!

345
00:19:34.780 --> 00:19:35.990
The antibody is right there,

346
00:19:35.990 --> 00:19:37.740
but we can't break
through their defense

347
00:19:37.740 --> 00:19:39.580
no matter what we try!

348
00:19:39.580 --> 00:19:41.540
We're all going to
die at this rate!

349
00:19:41.540 --> 00:19:44.420
But why? We're on
Master Queen's side!

350
00:19:44.420 --> 00:19:46.420
[APOO]
No point in whining about it.

351
00:19:46.420 --> 00:19:48.040
He doesn't give a damn.

352
00:19:48.040 --> 00:19:49.210
We're so close!

353
00:19:49.210 --> 00:19:51.170
All we gotta do is
kill one measly raccoon

354
00:19:51.170 --> 00:19:53.630
and the antibody is ours!

355
00:19:53.970 --> 00:19:55.430
Damn it, Drake!

356
00:19:55.430 --> 00:19:58.850
This is all your fault,
you stinkin' traitor!

357
00:19:59.220 --> 00:20:02.310
Stop pretending you're
some kinda hero!

358
00:20:02.310 --> 00:20:03.690
[DAIKOKU]
Drake isn't the only problem

359
00:20:03.690 --> 00:20:05.900
we're dealing with right now.

360
00:20:05.900 --> 00:20:08.270
The withered old man
got his strength back!

361
00:20:08.270 --> 00:20:10.940
Don't ask me how
he pulled that one off!

362
00:20:11.940 --> 00:20:14.110
[DAIKOKU]
Everyone in Wano
either respected

363
00:20:14.110 --> 00:20:16.070
or feared this man.

364
00:20:14.860 --> 00:20:18.360
<b>X Drake

Former Soaring Six Member
Saur-Saur Fruit: Allosaurus</b>
<b>Hyogoro "the Flower"

Legendary Boss of the Underworld</b>

365
00:20:16.070 --> 00:20:18.370
Hyogoro the Flower.

366
00:20:20.580 --> 00:20:23.540
That's an iron-tight defense
if I've ever seen one.

367
00:20:23.540 --> 00:20:25.580
We're not getting anywhere
near that raccoon

368
00:20:25.580 --> 00:20:27.880
with both of them guarding him.

369
00:20:28.590 --> 00:20:30.050
[HANZO]
What happened to Hyogoro?

370
00:20:30.050 --> 00:20:32.800
He was just a little old man
a second ago!

371
00:20:33.460 --> 00:20:35.470
[KAZEKAGE]
That's what he
looked like back in his prime,

372
00:20:35.470 --> 00:20:38.680
when Kaido was pounding down
his door, trying to recruit him!

373
00:20:40.880 --> 00:20:43.180
[chuckles]
I can't stop shaking!

374
00:20:43.180 --> 00:20:46.520
Are you all right, Boss?
It's still you in there?

375
00:20:47.060 --> 00:20:51.980
Yes. I can feel the chill,
but that's fine!

376
00:20:51.980 --> 00:20:55.780
My mind is sharp
and my body is ready!

377
00:20:57.660 --> 00:21:00.830
[HYOGORO]
The virus got me,
but not how I expected.

378
00:21:00.830 --> 00:21:02.910
It's drawn out all my strength.

379
00:21:02.910 --> 00:21:06.460
Down to the last inch
of my life!

380
00:21:08.540 --> 00:21:11.380
If that's what it's
come to, fine.

381
00:21:12.110 --> 00:21:16.110
I can put this final burst
of power to good use.

382
00:21:16.110 --> 00:21:20.950
[Hyogoro yells]

383
00:21:20.950 --> 00:21:23.950
In exchange for
this life that I give,

384
00:21:23.950 --> 00:21:27.410
I'll cut down all of
their strongest fighters.

385
00:21:29.540 --> 00:21:31.380
Now, come at me if you dare!

386
00:21:31.380 --> 00:21:33.000
[all gasp]

387
00:21:34.630 --> 00:21:37.050
Friends, listen closely.

388
00:21:37.050 --> 00:21:39.130
[ALL]
– Yes, we're ready, Boss!
– Yes, we're ready, Boss!

389
00:21:42.800 --> 00:21:46.560
Win or lose, I can tell
I don't have much time left.

390
00:21:46.560 --> 00:21:47.850
[Cho gasps]

391
00:21:48.980 --> 00:21:51.140
[HYOGORO]
There's a chance
Mister Raccoon's cure

392
00:21:51.140 --> 00:21:53.060
won't make it to me in time.

393
00:21:53.060 --> 00:21:56.070
In other words,
I might turn into an Ice Oni.

394
00:21:56.690 --> 00:21:58.480
We can't have that.

395
00:21:59.240 --> 00:22:04.370
If it happens, cut me down
without hesitation.

396
00:22:05.830 --> 00:22:07.490
That's the only way.

397
00:22:07.490 --> 00:22:10.540
Otherwise,
I'll go after you all,

398
00:22:10.540 --> 00:22:12.670
attacking like a wild animal.

399
00:22:12.670 --> 00:22:16.340
And I won't stop until
you're dead at my feet.

400
00:22:17.000 --> 00:22:18.550
I could never.

401
00:22:18.550 --> 00:22:21.090
We must. And we must
do it the instant

402
00:22:21.090 --> 00:22:23.720
he begins to lose himself
to the plague.

403
00:22:25.680 --> 00:22:28.470
[CHO]
If he becomes an oni,
he'll be unstoppable.

404
00:22:28.470 --> 00:22:31.440
[panting]

405
00:22:33.310 --> 00:22:35.770
I'm counting on you.

406
00:22:36.760 --> 00:22:39.220
Don't worry, we'll handle him.

407
00:22:39.220 --> 00:22:40.930
We have a reputation to uphold.

408
00:22:40.930 --> 00:22:44.100
We were the Mimawari-gumi,
after all.

409
00:22:45.230 --> 00:22:47.900
As for your tales of glory.

410
00:22:47.900 --> 00:22:50.290
We'll consign them to
the pages of history.

411
00:22:50.290 --> 00:22:50.870
Move it or die! Here we come!

412
00:22:50.870 --> 00:22:53.630
Move it or die!

413
00:22:53.920 --> 00:22:56.050
Here we come!

414
00:22:58.510 --> 00:23:02.680
[yells]

415
00:23:02.680 --> 00:23:05.640
[all scream]

416
00:23:14.520 --> 00:23:17.110
One Sword Style of the Flower!

417
00:23:29.230 --> 00:23:31.280
Special Technique.

418
00:23:38.280 --> 00:23:43.290
Flaming Hair of Holy Rage!

419
00:23:44.040 --> 00:23:48.290
[Hyogoro yells]

420
00:23:48.290 --> 00:23:50.920
[Ninjas scream]

421
00:23:52.910 --> 00:23:57.620
<b>Flaming</b>

422
00:23:53.660 --> 00:23:57.620
<b>Hair of</b>

423
00:23:54.410 --> 00:23:57.620
<b>Holy</b>

424
00:23:54.910 --> 00:23:57.620
<b>Rage</b>

425
00:23:57.380 --> 00:24:00.850
[exhales]

426
00:24:06.100 --> 00:24:08.940
Everyone attack at once!
Let's go!

427
00:24:08.940 --> 00:24:15.860
[Beast Pirates yelling]

428
00:24:15.860 --> 00:24:20.700
[Hyogoro chuckles]
It's funny, Oden.

429
00:24:23.580 --> 00:24:26.370
[HYOGORO]
I always think of
what could have been.

430
00:24:27.080 --> 00:24:30.250
[Beast Pirates groan]

431
00:24:30.250 --> 00:24:31.500
[HYOGORO]
I can't help but wonder

432
00:24:31.500 --> 00:24:33.300
if we might have beaten Kaido,

433
00:24:33.300 --> 00:24:36.130
if we'd challenged him
back when I was young.

434
00:24:36.130 --> 00:24:38.300
[Beast Pirates yell]

435
00:24:38.300 --> 00:24:40.010
[Hyogoro grunts]

436
00:24:40.010 --> 00:24:42.180
[Both gasp]

437
00:24:42.720 --> 00:24:45.310
[Beast Pirates groan]

438
00:24:48.900 --> 00:24:51.440
[HYOGORO]
But there's
no need for regrets.

439
00:24:51.440 --> 00:24:55.360
Kin'emon and the others
have executed a perfect raid!

440
00:24:57.860 --> 00:25:00.700
[HYOGORO]
And I met a fascinating man.

441
00:25:00.700 --> 00:25:04.200
One who became my disciple,
in a sense.

442
00:25:04.620 --> 00:25:07.200
[yells]

443
00:25:11.630 --> 00:25:13.130
Listen, Mister Straw Hat.

444
00:25:13.130 --> 00:25:16.050
You have much more
potential to unlock.

445
00:25:16.050 --> 00:25:19.420
I'm certain that
you'll see it in time.

446
00:25:19.420 --> 00:25:23.100
Remember, in the
midst of danger

447
00:25:24.050 --> 00:25:26.810
is when true power blossoms!

448
00:25:33.230 --> 00:25:36.280
If we team up, we can win this.

449
00:25:39.440 --> 00:25:41.030
'Course we can!

450
00:25:41.030 --> 00:25:44.160
I can punch through anything
now that you've taught me Ryuo!

451
00:25:44.160 --> 00:25:47.620
This time I'll kick
Kaido's sorry ass!

452
00:25:49.710 --> 00:25:52.540
[HYOGORO]
Those were words
of unshakeable conviction,

453
00:25:52.540 --> 00:25:54.540
and I still believe them.

454
00:25:54.540 --> 00:25:59.510
He'll achieve mastery
of Ryuo and become stronger.

455
00:26:00.170 --> 00:26:02.970
Kaido will fall!

456
00:26:02.970 --> 00:26:05.850
Your dream yet lives, Oden.

457
00:26:05.850 --> 00:26:10.270
[screams]

458
00:26:08.100 --> 00:26:10.270
[Sarutobi, Chome scream]

459
00:26:10.270 --> 00:26:13.650
[HYOGORO]
The Land of Wano will be reborn.

460
00:26:13.650 --> 00:26:17.190
A new dawn will come at last!

461
00:26:18.820 --> 00:26:20.440
[QUEEN]
Aw hell no!

462
00:26:20.440 --> 00:26:23.620
He's gonna wipe out
the whole floor!

463
00:26:25.580 --> 00:26:26.660
Huh?

464
00:26:26.660 --> 00:26:31.580
[QUEEN]
Suck on this, you old fart!

465
00:26:31.580 --> 00:26:36.920
[MARCO]
Phoenix Brand!

466
00:26:36.920 --> 00:26:41.050
[Marco chuckles]

467
00:26:41.050 --> 00:26:42.930
He's not your only enemy here!

468
00:26:42.930 --> 00:26:44.180
Watch your back!

469
00:26:47.050 --> 00:26:48.190
[Queen groans]
Marco!
The hell did you do to me?

470
00:26:48.190 --> 00:26:50.270
[Sanji gasps]
What the hell did you do to me?

471
00:26:50.270 --> 00:26:51.940
Was that a shockwave?

472
00:26:51.940 --> 00:26:55.020
[MARCO]
I dunno, keep fighting
me and maybe you'll find out!

473
00:26:55.020 --> 00:26:57.940
You won't lay a finger on
those samurai on my watch.

474
00:26:57.940 --> 00:27:00.900
If you want my head,
you'd better get to chopping!

475
00:27:00.900 --> 00:27:03.490
[QUEEN]
You wanna
jump in the frying pan?

476
00:27:03.490 --> 00:27:06.740
Fine, help yourself!

477
00:27:08.030 --> 00:27:13.660
[QUEEN]
Go to hell,
you stupid chicken!

478
00:27:13.660 --> 00:27:16.500
[King grunts]

479
00:27:27.350 --> 00:27:29.600
Bluebird!

480
00:27:42.070 --> 00:27:43.320
[King gasps]

481
00:27:43.320 --> 00:27:45.160
[Marco yells]

482
00:27:51.580 --> 00:27:54.830
You bastard.
You've had enough fun.

483
00:27:54.830 --> 00:27:57.080
I'm putting you down!

484
00:27:57.080 --> 00:28:02.550
I'll use your feathers
to pick my teeth.

485
00:28:02.550 --> 00:28:05.470
[MARCO]
Crane Talons!

486
00:28:20.020 --> 00:28:20.980
[Marco panting]
This ain't easy!

487
00:28:20.980 --> 00:28:23.440
Both these guys have bounties
worth over a billion.

488
00:28:23.440 --> 00:28:26.860
There's a limit to how long
I can keep holding them off!

489
00:28:30.870 --> 00:28:35.370
[panting]
You're gonna pay!

490
00:28:39.530 --> 00:28:45.620
[panting]

491
00:28:40.370 --> 00:28:45.620
[Marco panting]

492
00:28:45.620 --> 00:28:52.630
[panting]
You better
hurry, Raccoon!

493
00:28:53.560 --> 00:28:55.480
[PEROSPERO]
Hot lickity-damn.

494
00:28:55.480 --> 00:28:58.350
Why, I do believe
that's Marco over there.

495
00:28:58.780 --> 00:29:01.830
Lickity-looks like
he's seen better days!

496
00:29:01.830 --> 00:29:03.820
[yelling]

497
00:29:03.820 --> 00:29:06.610
[Samurai A gasps]
They're turning back into oni,

498
00:29:06.610 --> 00:29:08.610
one after another!

499
00:29:08.610 --> 00:29:14.660
[panting]

500
00:29:12.410 --> 00:29:16.240
[Samurai B groans]

501
00:29:24.790 --> 00:29:27.670
Do it! I'm not afraid!

502
00:29:30.670 --> 00:29:32.090
[gasps]

503
00:29:32.890 --> 00:29:34.350
[chuckles]

504
00:29:35.680 --> 00:29:39.850
[HYOGORO]
This is a blessing.
A parting gift, you might say.

505
00:29:39.850 --> 00:29:43.690
I thought that all I had left
to do was wait for death,

506
00:29:43.690 --> 00:29:45.770
and yet I came this far.

507
00:29:45.770 --> 00:29:51.490
[Samurai crying]

508
00:29:51.490 --> 00:29:51.550
[HYOGORO]
But this is enough.

509
00:29:51.550 --> 00:29:53.660
But this is enough.

510
00:29:53.660 --> 00:29:56.990
I won't put your lives at risk
because I was careless.

511
00:29:56.990 --> 00:30:00.620
I'm sorry to give you
such a grisly task,

512
00:30:00.620 --> 00:30:03.560
but please do this for me.

513
00:30:12.470 --> 00:30:16.220
[HYOGORO]
I leave Wano's
future in your hands.

514
00:30:17.180 --> 00:30:20.680
So ends Hyogoro the Flower.

515
00:30:23.690 --> 00:30:28.650
[HYOGORO]
I have no regrets.
I am at peace.
